# launch-compliance ignore rules for this repository.
#
# This repo is a skill distribution, not a product. examples/demo-project is a
# deliberately broken Next.js fixture -- its findings are the scanner working
# as intended, not a to-do list for us. Suppressing them here keeps the
# self-scan readable, and doubles as a worked example of the ignore file.
#
# Format: one finding id per line. Add `:path-prefix` to scope a rule, which
# drops evidence under that path and drops the finding with it if nothing is
# left to point at. `#` starts a comment.
#
# Rule of thumb for your own project: suppress a finding when you have decided
# it does not apply, not when you would rather not deal with it. Anything you
# suppress should have a comment saying why.

# --- Findings that belong to the fixture, scoped to it ------------------
docs.privacy-policy-missing:examples/
docs.terms-missing-with-payments:examples/
docs.subprocessors-missing:examples/
docs.cookie-policy-missing:examples/
ai.provider-disclosure:examples/
risk.special-category:examples/
content.user-uploads:examples/
launch.robots-blocks-all:examples/
launch.framework-title:examples/
launch.insecure-assets:examples/
launch.pre-ticked-consent:examples/
a11y.img-missing-alt:examples/
a11y.div-as-button:examples/
a11y.focus-removed:examples/
a11y.placeholder-as-label:examples/

# --- The scanner detecting itself ---------------------------------------
# scan.py contains `document.cookie` and friends as regex literals, so the
# storage detector matches its own source. A tool that reads code will always
# have this edge where the code is *about* code. Scoped rather than blanket,
# so the same finding would still fire if it ever came from real source.
docs.cookie-policy-missing:launch-compliance/scripts/

# --- Absence findings, which have no path to scope them to --------------
# This repository is classified as a web project because the fixture declares a
# Next.js dependency. It serves no pages of its own, so none of the following
# apply to it.
launch.og-tags-missing
launch.twitter-tags-missing
launch.canonical-missing
launch.meta-description-missing
launch.favicon-missing
launch.manifest-missing
launch.sitemap-missing
docs.compliance-missing
mechanism.deletion-missing
mechanism.export-missing
